# Provider Patterns
- Every provider implements `LlmProvider` trait from `crates/core/src/traits.rs`
- v1 uses reqwest for HTTP; native SDKs planned for v2
- Anthropic: POST /v1/messages with x-api-key, anthropic-version headers
- OpenAI: POST /v1/chat/completions with Bearer auth
- OpenRouter: OpenAI-compatible at openrouter.ai with HTTP-Referer header
- Tool schemas go through `tool_formats.rs` for cross-provider translation
- All provider errors map to `ProviderError` in `crates/core/src/error.rs`
